     "type": "box",
     "kind": "culture",
     "title": "Where the words come from",
     "items": [
      "**Nakú** is a shortened form of **Ináy ko pô!** (*Oh my mother!*). It shows surprise, amazement or disbelief.",
      "Two interjections reflect the Spanish heritage of faith: **Susmaryosep!** (shortened from Jesus, Maria y Jose, or *Jesus, Mary and Joseph*) and **Sus!** (shortened form of *Jesus*)."
